    skos:example "Trocar calor entre um produto quente e óleo cru frio num trocador casco-e-tubo."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "FOMI 2026 operation leaf kept on its IRI; it no longer carries identity. The equivalence to the term function comes from the enriched export."@en ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "Folha de operação do FOMI 2026 mantida pelo IRI; deixa de carregar identidade. A equivalência à função de termo (ex.: aumento de pressão de líquido ≡ processo que realiza alguma função de bombeamento) vem do export enriquecido."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:isPrimitive true ;
    iof-av:primitiveRationale "Kept primitive in the core; the export adds the defining equivalence from the enriched term function."@en ;
    iof-av:primitiveRationale "Mantida primitiva no core; o export acrescenta a equivalência definidora a partir da função de termo enriquecida."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:adaptedFrom "McCabe, W.L., Smith, J.C. & Harriott, P. (2005). Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering, 7th ed. McGraw-Hill" ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-011 (leaf kept)" ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-024 §3" ;
    dcterms:source "McCabe, W.L., Smith, J.C. & Harriott, P. (2005). Unit Operations of Chemical Engineering, 7th ed. McGraw-Hill" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy copi:copi-core .

copi:COPI_0000011 owl:disjointWith copi:COPI_0000012 .   # liquid × gas pressure increase: exclusive qualifier

copi:COPI_0000015 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "loss of containment"@en , "perda de contenção"@pt-br ;
    rdfs:subClassOf obo:BFO_0000015 ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition "process in which contained material leaves its containment device other than through an outflow of its storing function"@en ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition "processo em que material contido deixa seu dispositivo de contenção por outra via que não um fluxo de saída da sua função de armazenamento"@pt-br ;
    rdfs:comment "process in which contained material leaves its containment device other than through an outflow of its storing function"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "processo em que material contido deixa seu dispositivo de contenção por outra via que não um fluxo de saída da sua função de armazenamento"@pt-br ;
    iof-av:semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom "if p is a 'loss of containment' then p is a 'process' in which contained material leaves its 'containment device' other than through an 'outflow' of the realization of its 'storing function'"@en ;
    iof-av:semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom "se p é uma 'perda de contenção' então p é um 'processo' em que material contido deixa seu 'dispositivo de contenção' por outra via que não um 'fluxo de saída' da realização da sua 'função de armazenamento'"@pt-br ;
    iof-av:firstOrderLogicAxiom "∀p (LossOfContainment(p) → Process(p))"@en ;
    skos:example "A leak at a flange; a tank overflow; a pipeline rupture."@en ;
    skos:example "Um vazamento num flange; o transbordamento de um tanque; a ruptura de um oleoduto."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "Unplanned process, kept from ODR-009 §3 for the integrity CQs (CQ34, failure propagation). It is the realization of no function: a material flow that is the outflow of no function — the definition says it by negation."@en ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "Processo não planejado, mantido do ODR-009 §3 para as CQs de integridade (CQ34, propagação de falhas). Não é a realização de função alguma: é um fluxo de material que não é fluxo de saída de nenhuma função — a definição em linguagem natural o diz pela negativa."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:isPrimitive true ;
    iof-av:primitiveRationale "Primitive: 'other than through an outflow' is a negation OWL cannot state over an open world."@en ;
    iof-av:primitiveRationale "Primitiva: 'por outra via que não um fluxo de saída' é uma negação que OWL não enuncia em mundo aberto."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:adaptedFrom "ISO 14224:2016 Petroleum, petrochemical and natural gas industries — Collection and exchange of reliability and maintenance data for equipment (taxonomy levels)" ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-009 §3" ;
    dcterms:source "ISO 14224:2016 Petroleum, petrochemical and natural gas industries — Collection and exchange of reliability and maintenance data for equipment (taxonomy levels) (failure modes: external leakage)" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy copi:copi-core .

fb:scheme a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    rdfs:label "Functional Basis function terms (Hirtz et al. 2002, Table 5)"@en , "Termos de função da Functional Basis (Hirtz et al. 2002, Tabela 5)"@pt-br ;
    dcterms:source "Hirtz, J., Stone, R.B., McAdams, D.A., Szykman, S. & Wood, K.L. (2002). A functional basis for engineering design: reconciling and evolving previous efforts. Research in Engineering Design 13(2), 65–82 — Table 5 and Appendix B" ;
    skos:note "The eight primary and twenty secondary terms are mirrored by the function classes of this ontology (skos:closeMatch); the tertiary terms are kept here only, as concepts, because they refine a secondary without changing the operation on the flow."@en , "Os oito termos primários e os vinte secundários são espelhados pelas classes de função desta ontologia (skos:closeMatch); os termos terciários ficam só aqui, como conceitos, porque refinam um secundário sem mudar a operação sobre o fluxo."@pt-br .
fb:Function a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:topConceptOf fb:scheme ; skos:prefLabel "Function"@en , "Função"@pt-br .
fb:Flow a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:topConceptOf fb:scheme ; skos:prefLabel "Flow"@en , "Fluxo"@pt-br ; skos:definition "material, energy or signal on which a function operates (Hirtz et al. 2002, Table 3)"@en .

fb:Branch a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Function ; skos:prefLabel "Branch"@en , "Ramificar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to cause a flow to no longer be joined or mixed, or to be distributed"@en ; skos:note "primary (class)"@en .
fb:Separate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Branch ; skos:prefLabel "Separate"@en , "Separar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to isolate a flow into distinct components; tertiary: divide, extract, remove"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Distribute a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Branch ; skos:prefLabel "Distribute"@en , "Distribuir"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to cause a flow to break up and spread over an area"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Channel a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Function ; skos:prefLabel "Channel"@en , "Canalizar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to cause a flow to move from one location to another"@en ; skos:note "primary (class)"@en .
fb:Import a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Channel ; skos:prefLabel "Import"@en , "Importar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to bring a flow in from outside the system boundary"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Export a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Channel ; skos:prefLabel "Export"@en , "Exportar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to send a flow out across the system boundary"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Transfer a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Channel ; skos:prefLabel "Transfer"@en , "Transferir"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to shift or convey a flow from one place to another; tertiary: transport, transmit"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Guide a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Channel ; skos:prefLabel "Guide"@en , "Guiar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to direct the course of a flow along a specific path; tertiary: translate, rotate, allow degree of freedom"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Connect a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Function ; skos:prefLabel "Connect"@en , "Conectar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to bring two or more flows together"@en ; skos:note "primary (class)"@en .
fb:Couple a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Connect ; skos:prefLabel "Couple"@en , "Acoplar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to join or bring together flows; tertiary: join, link"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Mix a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Connect ; skos:prefLabel "Mix"@en , "Misturar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to combine two flows into a single, uniform homogeneous mass"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Controlmagnitude a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Function ; skos:prefLabel "Control magnitude"@en , "Controlar magnitude"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to alter or govern the size or amplitude of a flow"@en ; skos:note "primary (class)"@en .
fb:Actuate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Controlmagnitude ; skos:prefLabel "Actuate"@en , "Atuar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to commence the flow of energy, signal or material in response to an imported control signal"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Regulate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Controlmagnitude ; skos:prefLabel "Regulate"@en , "Regular"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to adjust a flow in response to a control signal; tertiary: increase, decrease"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Change a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Controlmagnitude ; skos:prefLabel "Change"@en , "Mudar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to adjust a flow in a predetermined and fixed manner; tertiary: increment, decrement, shape, condition"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Stop a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Controlmagnitude ; skos:prefLabel "Stop"@en , "Interromper"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to cease, or prevent, the transfer of a flow; tertiary: prevent, inhibit"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Convert a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Function ; skos:prefLabel "Convert"@en , "Converter"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to change a flow from one form to another"@en ; skos:note "primary (class)"@en .
fb:Provision a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Function ; skos:prefLabel "Provision"@en , "Prover"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to accumulate or provide a flow"@en ; skos:note "primary (class)"@en .
fb:Store a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Provision ; skos:prefLabel "Store"@en , "Armazenar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to accumulate a flow; tertiary: contain, collect"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Supply a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Provision ; skos:prefLabel "Supply"@en , "Suprir"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to provide a flow from storage"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Signal a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Function ; skos:prefLabel "Signal"@en , "Sinalizar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to provide information on a flow: to sense, indicate or process a signal"@en ; skos:note "primary (class)"@en .
fb:Sense a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Signal ; skos:prefLabel "Sense"@en , "Sentir"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to perceive, or become aware of, a flow; tertiary: detect, measure"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Indicate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Signal ; skos:prefLabel "Indicate"@en , "Indicar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to make something known to the user about a flow; tertiary: track, display"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Process a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Signal ; skos:prefLabel "Process"@en , "Processar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to submit a signal to a particular treatment or method having a set number of operations or steps"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Support a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Function ; skos:prefLabel "Support"@en , "Suportar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to firmly fix a flow (an object) into a defined location, or secure or position it"@en ; skos:note "primary (class)"@en .
fb:Stabilize a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Support ; skos:prefLabel "Stabilize"@en , "Estabilizar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to prevent an object from changing course or location"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Secure a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Support ; skos:prefLabel "Secure"@en , "Fixar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to firmly fix an object to a location"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Position a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Support ; skos:prefLabel "Position"@en , "Posicionar"@pt-br ; skos:definition "function to place an object into a specific location or orientation"@en ; skos:note "secondary (basic)"@en .
fb:Divide a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Separate ; skos:prefLabel "Divide"@en , "Dividir"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Extract a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Separate ; skos:prefLabel "Extract"@en , "Extrair"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Remove a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Separate ; skos:prefLabel "Remove"@en , "Remover"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Transport a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Transfer ; skos:prefLabel "Transport"@en , "Transportar"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Transmit a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Transfer ; skos:prefLabel "Transmit"@en , "Transmitir"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Translate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Guide ; skos:prefLabel "Translate"@en , "Transladar"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Rotate a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Guide ; skos:prefLabel "Rotate"@en , "Rotacionar"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:AllowDOF a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Guide ; skos:prefLabel "Allow degree of freedom"@en , "Permitir grau de liberdade"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Join a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Couple ; skos:prefLabel "Join"@en , "Unir"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Link a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Couple ; skos:prefLabel "Link"@en , "Ligar"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Increase a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Regulate ; skos:prefLabel "Increase"@en , "Aumentar"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Decrease a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Regulate ; skos:prefLabel "Decrease"@en , "Diminuir"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Increment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Change ; skos:prefLabel "Increment"@en , "Incrementar"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Decrement a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Change ; skos:prefLabel "Decrement"@en , "Decrementar"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Shape a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Change ; skos:prefLabel "Shape"@en , "Dar forma"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Condition a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Change ; skos:prefLabel "Condition"@en , "Condicionar"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Prevent a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Stop ; skos:prefLabel "Prevent"@en , "Impedir"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Inhibit a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Stop ; skos:prefLabel "Inhibit"@en , "Inibir"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Contain a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Store ; skos:prefLabel "Contain"@en , "Conter"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Collect a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Store ; skos:prefLabel "Collect"@en , "Coletar"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Detect a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Sense ; skos:prefLabel "Detect"@en , "Detectar"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Measure a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Sense ; skos:prefLabel "Measure"@en , "Medir"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Track a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Indicate ; skos:prefLabel "Track"@en , "Rastrear"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .
fb:Display a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme fb:scheme ; skos:broader fb:Indicate ; skos:prefLabel "Display"@en , "Exibir"@pt-br ; skos:note "tertiary (flow-restricted)"@en .

copi:COPI_0001068 a owl:AnnotationProperty ;
    rdfs:label "signature"@en , "assinatura"@pt-br ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition "JSON signature of a term function: verb, secondary, tertiary, inflows, outflows, primary flow, interface"@en ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition "assinatura JSON de uma função de termo: verbo, secundário, terciário, fluxos de entrada, fluxos de saída, fluxo primário, interface"@pt-br ;
    skos:example "On the pumping function: {verb: Convert, inflows: [liquid, mechanical energy], outflows: [liquid+hydraulic energy], primary_flow: liquid}."@en ;
    skos:example "Na função de bombeamento: {verbo: Convert, entradas: [líquido, energia mecânica], saídas: [líquido+energia hidráulica], fluxo primário: líquido}."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "Mirrors the process_signature of enrichment.db; it is what the compatibility rule of ODR-025 §3 reads."@en ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "Espelha o process_signature do enrichment.db; é o que a regra de compatibilidade do ODR-025 §3 lê."@pt-br ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-025" ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-025 §1–2" ;
    dcterms:source "Mizoguchi, R., Kitamura, Y. & Borgo, S. (2016). A unifying definition for artifact and biological functions. Applied Ontology 11(2), 129–154" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy copi:copi-core .
copi:COPI_0001069 a owl:AnnotationProperty ;
    rdfs:label "primary function"@en , "função primária"@pt-br ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition "IRI of the function that gives the artifact its box (curation convention; design context)"@en ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition "IRI da função que dá ao artefato sua caixa (convenção de curadoria; contexto de projeto)"@pt-br ;
    skos:example "On the reboiler: the phase change function (Convert), not the mechanical separation function (Branch)."@en ;
    skos:example "No refervedor: a função de mudança de fase (Convert), não a de separação mecânica (Branch)."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "The transformative cell; if none, the one the standard's definition names first. A curation convention, not an ontological commitment: a design context in the sense of Mizoguchi, Kitamura & Borgo (2016)."@en ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "A célula de verbo transformativo; se nenhuma, a que a definição da norma nomeia primeiro. Convenção de curadoria, não compromisso ontológico: um contexto de projeto no sentido de Mizoguchi, Kitamura & Borgo (2016)."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:adaptedFrom "Mizoguchi, R., Kitamura, Y. & Borgo, S. (2016). A unifying definition for artifact and biological functions. Applied Ontology 11(2), 129–154" ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-025" ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-025 §1–2" ;
    dcterms:source "Mizoguchi, R., Kitamura, Y. & Borgo, S. (2016). A unifying definition for artifact and biological functions. Applied Ontology 11(2), 129–154" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy copi:copi-core .
copi:COPI_0001070 a owl:AnnotationProperty ;
    rdfs:label "identity function"@en , "função de identidade"@pt-br ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition "IRI of the term function whose signature individuates the artifact type"@en ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition "IRI da função de termo cuja assinatura individua o tipo de artefato"@pt-br ;
    skos:example "On the pump: the pumping function, whose signature ⟨Convert, liquid + mechanical energy in, liquid + hydraulic energy out⟩ is what makes a pump a pump."@en ;
    skos:example "Na bomba: a função de bombeamento, cuja assinatura ⟨Convert, líquido + energia mecânica entrando, líquido + energia hidráulica saindo⟩ é o que faz de uma bomba uma bomba."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "OWL does not express 'exactly one identity-giving function' without reification; the annotation records the choice (ODR-025 §1)."@en ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "OWL não expressa 'exatamente uma função identitária' sem reificar; a anotação registra a escolha (ODR-025 §1)."@pt-br ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-025" ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-025 §1–2" ;
    dcterms:source "Mizoguchi, R., Kitamura, Y. & Borgo, S. (2016). A unifying definition for artifact and biological functions. Applied Ontology 11(2), 129–154" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy copi:copi-core .
copi:COPI_0001071 a owl:AnnotationProperty ;
    rdfs:label "constructive type"@en , "tipo construtivo"@pt-br ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition "constructive differentia of the term (gate, ball, shell-and-tube), kept as annotation, never as functional subclass"@en ;
    iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition "differentia construtiva do termo (gaveta, esfera, casco-e-tubo), mantida como anotação, nunca como subclasse funcional"@pt-br ;
    skos:example "On the gate valve: 'gate'; on the shell-and-tube heat exchanger: 'shell and tube'."@en ;
    skos:example "Na válvula gaveta: 'gaveta'; no trocador casco-e-tubo: 'casco e tubo'."@pt-br ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "Separates the constructive aspect from the functional one (ODR-026 §5): constructive types bear the genus function and are primitive."@en ;
    iof-av:explanatoryNote "Separa o aspecto construtivo do funcional (ODR-026 §5): tipos construtivos portam a função do gênero e são primitivos."@pt-br ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-025" ;
    dcterms:source "ODR-025 §1–2" ;
    dcterms:source "Mizoguchi, R., Kitamura, Y. & Borgo, S. (2016). A unifying definition for artifact and biological functions. Applied Ontology 11(2), 129–154" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy copi:copi-core .

